flowchart TB
U[Users] --> EDGE[CDN / Edge / TLS]
EDGE --> WEB[Rkestr Web]
WEB --> ING[Ingress / Load Balancer]
ING --> API1[Rkestr API Replica]
ING --> API2[Rkestr API Replica]
API1 --> PG[(Managed PostgreSQL)]
API2 --> PG
API1 --> MQ[(Managed Message Broker)]
API2 --> MQ
MQ --> W1[Worker Runtime]
MQ --> W2[Worker Runtime]
W1 --> PG
W2 --> PG
W1 --> EXT[Notification Providers]
W2 --> EXT
API1 --> OBJ[(Object Storage)]
API2 --> OBJ
SEC[Managed Secrets] -.-> API1
SEC -.-> API2
SEC -.-> W1
SEC -.-> W2
OBS[Logs / Metrics / Traces] -.-> API1
OBS -.-> API2
OBS -.-> W1
OBS -.-> W2
